## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to design offline-first data flow, practical Core Data usage, and simple conflict resolution in a beginner-friendly setting relevant to fintech companies.

## Key Concepts

- Offline-first persistence with Core Data
- Upsert and conflict resolution using updatedAt
- SwiftUI data binding with @FetchRequest
- Network fetch via URLSession and JSON decoding

